msgid "Use WinRM over HTTPS"
msgstr "Tumia WinRM kupitia HTTPS"

#: setup.php
msgid "Default for accounts that inherit server settings. Configure and trust the target certificate; certificate checks are not disabled."
msgstr "Chaguo-msingi kwa akaunti zinazorithi mipangilio ya seva. Sanidi na uamini cheti lengwa; ukaguzi wa vyeti haujazimwa."

