msgstr "Mlango chaguo-msingi mbadala kwa akaunti zinazorithi mipangilio ya seva. Acha wazi kwa chaguo-msingi la Windows."

#: setup.php wmi_accounts.php
msgid "WinRM Authentication"
msgstr "Uthibitishaji wa WinRM"

#: setup.php
msgid "Default for accounts that inherit server settings. Use Kerberos for domain hosts where available. Basic requires HTTPS."
msgstr "Chaguo-msingi kwa akaunti zinazorithi mipangilio ya seva. Tumia Kerberos kwa vipangishi vya kikoa vinapopatikana. Uthibitishaji wa msingi unahitaji HTTPS."

